<section class="vm-discovery vm-container" data-discovery data-catalog-url="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}"><nav class="sf-breadcrumb"><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}">Início</a><span>/</span><a href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">Vinhos</a><span>/</span><span data-discovery-breadcrumb>Descobertas</span></nav><h1 data-discovery-title>Encontre seu próximo vinho</h1><p class="vm-discovery-intro" data-discovery-intro>Explore a Videira.</p>
<div class="vm-pairing-filter-links" data-pairing-links hidden><a href="{{ collection.url }}?view=descobrir&amp;harmonizacao=pizzas">Pizzas</a><a href="{{ collection.url }}?view=descobrir&amp;harmonizacao=carnes-vermelhas">Carnes vermelhas</a><a href="{{ collection.url }}?view=descobrir&amp;harmonizacao=queijos">Queijos</a><a href="{{ collection.url }}?view=descobrir&amp;harmonizacao=massas">Massas</a><a href="{{ routes.root_url }}#harmonizacoes">Todas as harmonizações</a></div><button class="vm-favorites-clear mi-outline" type="button" data-favorites-clear hidden>Limpar favoritos</button>
<p class="vm-discovery-status" role="status" aria-live="polite" data-discovery-status>Consultando os dados dos vinhos…</p><button type="button" data-discovery-retry hidden>Tentar novamente</button><div class="sf-catalog-grid vm-discovery-results" data-discovery-results></div><button type="button" class="mi-outline vm-discovery-more" data-discovery-more hidden>Mostrar mais vinhos</button><noscript><p>Ative o JavaScript para filtrar o catálogo. Você também pode <a href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}">explorar todos os vinhos</a>.</p></noscript>
{% paginate collection.products by 48 %}<div data-discovery-batch data-next="{{ paginate.next.url }}" hidden>{% for product in collection.products %}{% capture origin %}{% render 'product-fact', product: product, field: 'country' %}{% endcapture %}{% capture pairing %}{% render 'product-fact', product: product, field: 'pairing' %}{% endcapture %}<template data-discovery-card data-id="{{ product.id }}" data-pairing="{{ pairing | strip | escape }}" data-country="{{ origin | strip | escape }}" data-price="{{ product.price }}" data-available="{{ product.available }}">{% render 'product-card', product: product %}</template>{% capture kit_card %}{% render 'kit-card', product: product %}{% endcapture %}{% assign kit_card = kit_card | strip %}{% if kit_card != blank %}<template data-discovery-kit data-id="{{ product.id }}">{{ kit_card }}</template>{% endif %}{% endfor %}</div>{% endpaginate %}
</section>
{% schema %}{"name":"Videira · Descobertas","settings":[]}{% endschema %}
